  "summary": [
    "Search returns documents related to a task, prioritizing no omissions over precision",
    "Search uses the ToC for the given key, or the reserved key all when omitted",
    "Missing ToC leads to a report that an initial build is required",
    "Pre-search check of whether a rebuild is needed, using the saved index target specification",
    "User chooses between rebuilding then searching, or searching the existing ToC as is",
    "Target specification file records the checked key and specification so the rebuild targets the same documents",
    "Rebuild scale shown as counts, with details written to a work file",
    "Search stops as a failure when rebuild necessity cannot be determined",
    "Search results contain document ID, path, reason, sections, and ToC state, with a staleness notice"
  ],
